{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43185","headline":"送韦员外赴朔方 · 郑严","name":"送韦员外赴朔方","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白露边秋早，皇华戎事催。\n已推仙省妙，更是幕中才。\n出饯倾朝列，深功伫帝台。\n坐闻长策利，终见勒铭回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑严","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43185.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43185","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}